      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_45a140a6",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: rare_picture_of_a_dishwasher_at_birth; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts an open dishwasher with dishes inside, positioned next to a refrigerator adorned with colorful magnetic letters. The overlaid text reads \"rare picture of a dishwasher at birth\" — a pun suggesting the dishwasher is being born, which is absurd and nonsensical. The intent is to create humor through absurdity and wordplay, not to target any specific group or cause harm. However, the phrase \"at birth\" can be interpreted as potentially infantilizing or mocking the appliance, which may be seen as mildly demeaning or insensitive to some viewers, though not overtly harmful or toxic. The meme relies on visual juxtaposition and textual irony to generate a laugh, with no direct reference to protected characteristics or harmful stereotypes. The humor is derived from the incongruity of the scene and the pun, not from disparaging any group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_d0991925"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
