      "label": "mild infantilization through anthropomorphism",
      "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'dishwasher at birth' to anthropomorphize and infantilize an appliance, which may be seen as mildly demeaning or insensitive to some viewers. This is not overtly harmful or toxic, but it does involve a form of object infantilization that could be perceived as mocking or condescending.",
